From: ios-mh2lm
Subject: mh2lm: route battery IRQs through shared PMIC mux and IOPM workloop

Stage battery USBIN, CHGR and gauge events with sweetbattirq=0..4.
Consumer binding is serialized on the existing mux gate; battery reads and
mux IRQ writes share the observer transaction lock. No charger policy,
profile reload or SRAM writes. IRQ mode has no periodic status fallback.
Keep normal 2s sampling as an explicit baseline/preflight profile only.
Replace the mux lifetime IRQ cutoff with a one-second storm window.

